    "Intuitive 3D for Graphic Designers",
    "",
    "717334",
    "<p>Add and edit 3D objects directly within Adobe Illustrator CC 2020 using the new Cineware for Illustrator plug-in. Apply your label artwork to 3D packaging or incorporate 3D elements seamlessly into your 2D artwork.<br /></p>",
    "717335",
    "<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qla-DMdxShE&amp;feature=emb_logo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch Video</a>",
    "1713787",
    "<p><strong>The Cineware for Illustrator plugin is available for <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">download here</a>.</strong></p>",
    "717340",
    "717341",
    "contentBuilder_image_BlockType",
    "717342",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_C4D_Globe.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_C4D_Globe.png",
    "717343",
    "What you can do with Cineware for Illustrator",
    "717344",
    "717345",
    "717346",
    "Objects",
    "left",
    "717347",
    "<p>Rotate, position and show/hide individual 3D objects from any Cinema 4D scene, all within Adobe Illustrator.</p>",
    "717348",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_primitives_v2.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_primitives_v2.png",
    "717349",
    "717350",
    "Materials",
    "717351",
    "<p>Adjust the color, reflection, luminance, transparency and bump within Adobe Illustrator. You can even apply vector artwork to the surface of 3D models.</p>",
    "717352",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_mat_v3.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_mat_v3.png",
    "717377",
    "717378",
    "717379",
    "Cameras",
    "717380",
    "<p>Switch between pre-set cameras or use simple navigation tools to choose your preferred viewing angle.</p>",
    "717381",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_cam_v2.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_cam_v2.png",
    "717382",
    "717383",
    "Lights",
    "717384",
    "<p>Enable or disable lights and change their color to set a mood and emphasize shapes.</p>",
    "717385",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_lights.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_lights.png",
    "717386",
    "717387",
    "contentBuilder_video_BlockType",
    "717388",
    "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R2kjYT5d5wA",
    "lightbox",
    "717389",
    "717390",
    "717391",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_icon_cube.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_icon_cube.png",
    "717392",
    "Dozens of objects to get you started",
    "717393",
    "<p>We’ve partnered with Turbosquid, the best online source for 3D models, to jump-start your journey into the 3rd dimension with packaging and other 3D object collections.<br /></p>",
    "717394",
    "<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t0hFmcDlvK8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch Video</a>",
    "<a href=\"https://www.turbosquid.com/cineware/browse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Visit Turbosquid</a>",
    "717397",
    "container",
    "717398",
    "contentBuilder_carousel_BlockType",
    "717399",
    "717400",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_packs.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_packs.png",
    "717401",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_books.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_books.png",
    "717402",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Cineware/Cineware_Illlustrator_bottles.png",
    "Cineware_Illlustrator_bottles.png",
    "717453",
    "717454",
    "717455",
    "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=06P-qkEfb3Y",
    "embed",
    "717456",
    "717457",
